    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s1_card_body",
      "x": 90,
      "y": 424,
      "width": 388.4765625,
      "height": 227.5,
      "text": "WHO AM I            SOUL.md\nHOW DO I OPERATE    CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md\nTHE PROJECT         overview + roadmap phase\nTRUE RIGHT NOW      current state of work\nLAST 2-3 DAYS       dated recent window (FR-005)\n                    incl. what failed = don't retry\nOWNER'S STYLE       how you like to work\nFOLDER MAP          1 line per folder (FR-006)\nMEMORY TOOLS        told, never guessed (FR-007)\nHOW I SEARCH        the ladder     -> scene 2\nHOW I SAVE          the gate       -> scene 4\nNEVER STORED        exclusion list -> scene 3\n--------------------------------------------\n! WARNINGS: 2 stale views (counts + links)",
