      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "When you say “include what\nfailed,” don't include\ncontext about the tools\nthe agents are using. That\ncould skew a future agent\ninto thinking we're\ninterested in tool usage\nand operational stuff the\nagent is doing when it's\nexecuting work.",
