      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "aoXX6hCW8yQNHucUd1-Ed",
      "originalText": "When you say “include what failed,” don't include context about the tools the agents are using. That could skew a future agent into thinking we're interested in tool usage and operational stuff the agent is doing when it's executing work.",
